== Foreign players ==
Each team can register a maximum of ten foreign players. However, only seven foreign players are allowed in the line-up for each match at any given time.<ref>{{cite web |title=Football Association of Thailand makes foreign player quota changes|date=25 Jan 2026 |url=https://www.bangkokpost.com/sports/3181215/football-association-of-thailand-makes-foreign-player-quota-changes}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Bubble Straightforwardly Analyzes How the New Thai League Foreign Player Quota Differs from the Old|date=19 Jan 2026 |url=https://en.thairath.co.th/sport/thaifootball/2908819}}</ref>

* Players named in '''bold''' indicates the player was registered during the mid-season transfer window.
* Former players named in ''italics'' are players that were out of squad or left the club within the season, after the pre-season transfer window, or in the mid-season transfer window, and at least had one appearance.
* Unregistered players refer to players who are not registered for the Thai League but still contracted to the team for other competitions.
